{"4905140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Riftshot", "steam_appid": 4905140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is in active development and all of this is subject to change.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a Riftshot?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftshot is a bombastic 3d Platformer without the need for platforms. Explore neon cities, snowy relics,  electric deserts, and more, utilizing your trusty grappling hook to shoot off into the sunrise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.poster.avif?t=1786143444\" aria-label=\"A green-haired girl uses a grappling hook to shoot between multiple colored skyscrapers.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.webm?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.mp4?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's a Riftshot About?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world not too dissimilar to ours, Olive Midorika is a wandering mechanic, who's recently arrived to the mysterious Stargrove Island to witness its majestic Aurora Festival. However, Somno Snuzy, the CEO of the megaconglomerate STARV Inc, is leading a hostile takeover of the island to siphon the power of the mysterious Aurora Shards, and to unlock the power of the ancient Caretaker civilization. Only one mage is willing to stop him, will you follow her? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/46495651aea0afc6d377ff6a3148262c.poster.avif?t=1786143444\" aria-label=\"A sharply dressed man named Somno boasts about how he will control everything.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/46495651aea0afc6d377ff6a3148262c.webm?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/46495651aea0afc6d377ff6a3148262c.mp4?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How do I work this?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To Navigate this wide and wild world, you're gonna need some skills. Olive can leap, bounce, wallrun, rail-grind, and even grapple onto and around almost any surface. And to attack, just grapple right into your enemies! Utilize these skills well, and you can zip at blistering speeds through the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/26a4944e31267186da30c704ca0ee0a9.poster.avif?t=1786143444\" aria-label=\"The same green-haired girl does flips and bounces off a grassy island with palm trees.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/26a4944e31267186da30c704ca0ee0a9.webm?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/26a4944e31267186da30c704ca0ee0a9.mp4?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Dense Worlds, handcrafted and packed with things to do!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGrapple onto or around almost any surface for extreme air!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA platforming moveset that encourages not just creativity, but improvisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPurchase a motley of different costumes and charms to spice up your experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tExperience a story about friendship, self-expression, and how your perception can change everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA groovy tracklist with trip-hop infused tunes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by one developer with no Generative &quot;AI&quot; whatsoever. Support human creators!!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is in active development and all of this is subject to change.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is a Riftshot?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riftshot is a bombastic 3d Platformer without the need for platforms. Explore neon cities, snowy relics,  electric deserts, and more, utilizing your trusty grappling hook to shoot off into the sunrise.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.poster.avif?t=1786143444\" aria-label=\"A green-haired girl uses a grappling hook to shoot between multiple colored skyscrapers.\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.webm?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4905140/extras/951aab73b6db8684a7b94d128c70a5b4.mp4?t=1786143444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's a Riftshot About?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 